<h1 class="chapter">18. Future Scope and Enhancement</h1>
<ol>
<li><strong>Dynamic Pricing:</strong> Auto-adjust prices based on demand/season.</li>
<li><strong>Loyalty Program:</strong> Rewards system and promo codes.</li>
<li><strong>Multi-Hotel:</strong> Central dashboard for multiple branches.</li>
<li><strong>NLP Chatbot:</strong> ML-based understanding (OpenAI/Hugging Face).</li>
<li><strong>OTA Integration:</strong> Sync with Booking.com, MakeMyTrip.</li>
<li><strong>Review System:</strong> Customer ratings and reviews.</li>
<li><strong>SMS Notifications:</strong> Twilio for booking alerts.</li>
<li><strong>Mobile App:</strong> React Native/Flutter for Android/iOS.</li>
<li><strong>Hashed Passwords:</strong> PBKDF2/Argon2 migration.</li>
<li><strong>Analytics:</strong> Interactive occupancy/revenue charts.</li>
</ol><h1 class="chapter">19. Glossary of Terms</h1>
